                                "sense_id": "2e24c82b-67cf-3534-8d51-6f62f1dd8f5e",
                                "text": "I sat for hours afterwards, gazing out of the cavern entrance at the moonlighted grove, silent and desolate beyond any telling."
                            }
                        ]
